Hanzo Frames is a fork. It has been rebranded and adapted for the Hanzo stack:
the package and identifiers were renamed hyperframes -> frames, and hosts point
at frames.hanzo.ai.

The JSON Schema identifiers ($schema) were remapped to frames.hanzo.ai/schema/*.
Those are dereferenced by validators, so the schema files in docs/schema/ MUST be
served at that path; until they are, the identifiers name a host that does not
answer.

The upstream HeyGen SaaS integration (CLI auth against heygen.com, api.heygen.com)
is deliberately retained unrenamed pending removal: it is a dependency on their
cloud rather than a name of ours to take.

Original attribution files (LICENSE, CREDITS.md) are carried forward unmodified.
